{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are trapped in a mysterious swimming pool. Observe the surroundings for any abnormalities and find a way to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape method</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do not ignore any abnormalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you find an abnormality, immediately return to the pool entrance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If no abnormalities are found, proceed to the pool exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Once all abnormalities are discovered, find the real Pool No. 8 and leave through the exit!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo Content</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accessible first 5 rounds of escape challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo ends automatically upon reaching Round 6 (Full version: 8 rounds)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At least 10 unique anomalies to discover (30 in the full version)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3656120?t=1745995792","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656120/de6139c21c3b2ffa927ac1155d4796c07243fd71/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745995792","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656120/3ed84de0852e12311e2827cd6f1e32fb4bc329bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745995792","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656120/3ed84de0852e12311e2827cd6f1e32fb4bc329bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745995792","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are trapped in a mysterious swimming pool. Observe the surroundings for any ab